  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "20260425.0.0 — Transport thread-safety and Chat lifecycle fix\n- Serializes FP transport SendAsync via SemaphoreSlim (TcpFpTransport, TlsFpTransport, WebSocketFpTransportBase); concurrent NetworkStream writes were corrupting the FP frame stream and causing ResignFederationExecution timeouts.\n- Fixes Chat MainViewModel.OnLocalUserReady to propagate the simulation CancellationToken to UpdateAsync, preventing a post-disconnect UI-thread write from racing the background resign.\n\n20260424.0.0 — Complete Support Services coverage (IEEE 1516-2025 §10)\n- Full §10.2-10.60 coverage: handle lookup, handle normalisation, exception/advisory switches.\n- EnableCallbacks / DisableCallbacks delivery gating in FpCallbackWorker.\n- LBTS/GALT federation-scoped index + dirty-federation grant scheduling; TSO heap for O(log n) head inspection.\n- Typed HLA exceptions for invalid handles, unpublished send/update, duplicate time-mode enables, and out-of-order advance requests.\n- Retired legacy hla.proto and Fora.Core.Proto escape hatch.\n- 266/266 integration tests green.\n\n20260423.4.0 — DDM coverage (IEEE 1516-2025 §9)\n- RequestAttributeValueUpdateWithRegions and region-aware UnassociateRegionsForUpdates.\n- RegisterObjectInstanceWithRegions now preserves attribute-region associations in simulator routing.\n- Full §9.2-9.13 integration coverage.",
